  "description_en": "Retrieves the information of the longest-matching active site for a given record name under the current user. For example, if the input record name is www.test.example.com and the user has two active sites (test.example.com and example.com), the API returns the longest-matching active site test.example.com. If no matching active site is found, an error is returned",
